{
  "_note": "THE APP MANIFEST GRAMMAR (architecture/proposals/studio-apps.md §3). A Despia app is an ordinary registry package whose dsx.json adds `studioApi` (the envelope, durability-P1 pattern) and `facets.apps` contribution rows into the CLOSED slot vocabulary, each carrying grants over the closed `studio` residence. This corpus drives BOTH validators — packages/cli/src/studio-apps/manifest.ts (TS: installed registry packages, the editor host, the shelf CI) and ClosedSource/scripts/check_studio_apps.rb (ruby: in-tree first-party app modules) — the lint_conformance two-validators-one-corpus pattern, because grammar with N validators and no shared fixtures is exactly where drift lives. Each case feeds `manifest` to the validator. `expect.app:false` = not an app at all (no facets.apps rows; both info and issues empty — callers must distinguish this from a broken app). `expect.ok:true` = a valid app; `contributions` pins how many rows survive and `grants` (when present) pins the install-dialog union in order. `expect.ok:false` = invalid; `codes` is the SORTED SET of issue codes — messages are deliberately uncompared (the lint_conformance rule: wording is free, the code is the contract). The vocabulary echoed under `vocabulary` is the same one OpenSource/Web/support/studio-api-v1.json pins; the TS runner asserts the two agree, so the contract artifact, this corpus and the validator cannot drift apart. Laws pinned here: studioApi is required on any manifest carrying rows and must equal the major this toolchain speaks; UI slots (studio.panel, studio.rail, studio.inspector.section, studio.style.section, dashboard.card) require component+title (the two RAIL PLACEMENTS - studio.panel, the docked side panel that is the default, and studio.rail, the full-window destination - also require icon, their identity mark in the rail) and may hold project:read/project:write/selection:read/net:<host> — never automation grants; automation rows have no component, bind `on` to a known editor or platform event, name `run` as a package-relative `Doc.dsx#action`, default mode draft (auto requires the automation:auto grant), and ALWAYS carry automation:deploy (installing one changes the user's deployment — the grant is how that is said); tool rows name their published `action`, carry `run` (the same package-relative `Doc.dsx#action` shape automations use — an interface is ONE consumer of an app, so every tool is invokable from the Studio, the CLI (`despia app run`) and the MCP face alike, under the same consented grants and the same narrowed document grammar), never bind `on`, and hold no grants; secret:/data: grants are automation-plane only; net:<host> is a bare lowercase host (suffix-match at the seam, the server egress rule verbatim); grants are validated fail-closed at the SEAM too — this grammar tier exists so a bad manifest never reaches one. Runners: packages/cli/test/studio-apps-manifest.test.ts (per-PR, npm test) + check_studio_apps.rb (per-PR, repo-gates lane).",
  "vocabulary": {
    "studioApi": 1,
    "slots": [
      "studio.panel",
      "studio.rail",
      "studio.inspector.section",
      "studio.style.section",
      "dashboard.card",
      "tool",
      "automation"
    ],
    "grants": [
      "project:read",
      "project:write",
      "selection:read",
      "net:<host>",
      "secret:<NAME>",
      "automation:deploy",
      "automation:auto",
      "data:<entity>"
    ],
    "editorEvents": [
      "document.saved",
      "document.opened",
      "selection.changed",
      "build.finished",
      "lint.finished",
      "deploy.requested",
      "deploy.finished",
      "app.installed",
      "app.enabled",
      "app.disabled"
    ],
    "platformEvents": [
      "platform.release.published",
      "platform.pr.opened",
      "platform.build.finished",
      "platform.order.created"
    ],
    "budgets": {
      "loopCap": 200000,
      "deadlineMs": 30000,
      "calls": 128
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "not an app — a manifest with no facets.apps rows is an ordinary package, silently",
      "manifest": {
        "name": "Camera",
        "scheme": "camera",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      },
      "expect": {
        "app": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "not an app — an underscore-only facets.apps block is annotation, not rows",
      "manifest": {
        "name": "X",
        "scheme": "x",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "facets": {
          "apps": {
            "_note": "someday"
          }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "app": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the minimal rail app — component, title, icon, one grant",
      "manifest": {
        "name": "AcmeCopy",
        "scheme": "acmecopy",
        "version": "1.2.0",
        "studioApi": 1,
        "facets": {
          "apps": {
            "copy-panel": {
              "slot": "studio.rail",
              "component": "Components/CopyPanel.dsx",
              "title": "Copy",
              "icon": "text.badge.star",
              "grants": [
                "project:read"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "contributions": 1,
        "grants": [
          "project:read"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the full app — every slot kind in one manifest, grants unioned in row order for the dialog",
      "manifest": {
        "name": "Acme",
        "scheme": "acme",
        "version": "2.0.0",
        "studioApi": 1,
        "facets": {
          "apps": {
            "board": {
              "slot": "studio.rail",
              "component": "Components/Board.dsx",
              "title": "Board",
              "icon": "square.grid.2x2",
              "order": "10",
              "grants": [
                "project:read",
                "project:write",
                "net:api.acme.dev"
              ],
              "events": [
                "document.saved",
                "selection.changed"
              ]
            },
            "tone": {
              "slot": "studio.style.section",
              "component": "Components/Tone.dsx",
              "title": "Tone",
              "order": "20",
              "grants": [
                "selection:read"
              ]
            },
            "insp": {
              "slot": "studio.inspector.section",
              "component": "Components/Inspect.dsx",
              "title": "Acme",
              "order": "30"
            },
            "card": {
              "slot": "dashboard.card",
              "component": "Components/Card.dsx",
              "title": "Acme health",
              "order": "40",
              "grants": [
                "net:api.acme.dev"
              ]
            },
            "gen": {
              "slot": "tool",
              "action": "generate",
              "title": "Generate",
              "description": "Generate copy for the selected screen",
              "order": "50",
              "run": "Server/Tools.dsx#generate"
            },
            "notes": {
              "slot": "automation",
              "on": "platform.release.published",
              "run": "Server/Automations.dsx#draftNotes",
              "mode": "draft",
              "order": "60",
              "grants": [
                "automation:deploy",
                "net:api.acme.dev",
                "secret:ACME_KEY"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "contributions": 6,
        "grants": [
          "project:read",
          "project:write",
          "net:api.acme.dev",
          "selection:read",
          "automation:deploy",
          "secret:ACME_KEY"
        ]
      }
    },
